  ": data": "：数据",
  "A factor can measure a pattern without predicting a later move, and an apparent prediction can lose its edge after costs. Read each gate separately. A failed or unevaluated gate is a limitation, not a positive recommendation.": "因子可以衡量某种模式，却不能预测后续变动；预测优势也可能被成本抵消。请分别检查每道门槛。失败或未评估表示局限，不代表积极推荐。",
  "A factor measures a defined property. Rank IC is a rank correlation used to evaluate predictive information. Measure, incremental information, prediction, net cost and consistency are separate research gates.": "因子衡量定义明确的属性。秩 IC 是评估预测信息的秩相关系数。衡量、增量信息、预测、净成本和一致性是不同的研究门槛。",
  "A research stance is a recorded relative position within an asset pool, never an instruction to place an order. A composite score combines weighted factor measurements. A higher score does not establish lower risk or a profitable future return.": "研究立场是资产池内记录的相对位置，不是下单指令。综合分数结合加权因子测量。分数较高不能证明风险较低或未来盈利。",
  "A signal can describe today's market well and still predict nothing. A factor can predict and still lose its edge to costs. A strategy can make money for a reason other than the one in its name.": "信号可能很好地描述今天的市场，却无法预测。因子可能具备预测力，但成本会抵消优势。策略盈利的原因也可能与名称暗示的不同。",
  "A signed contribution shows how a recorded factor enters the score. A negative contribution does not prove a negative future return. Coverage describes available data, not confidence.": "带符号的贡献表示因子如何进入分数。负贡献不能证明未来收益为负。覆盖率代表数据可用性，不是置信度。",
