  "Synthetic gate outcomes and measurements are generated independently. Reported outcomes are displayed as supplied, even when a value and threshold appear inconsistent.": "合成门槛结果与测量值独立生成。即使数值与阈值看似不一致，仍按来源原样显示结果。",
  "The as-of date is the decision context, not today's date. SYNTHETIC means fictional instruments and generated numbers. REPLAY uses sample data and recorded model answers. REAL identifies source-reported live data and calls.": "决策日期是数据背景，不是今天的日期。SYNTHETIC表示虚构标的与生成数值；REPLAY使用样本数据和已记录的模型回答；REAL表示来源报告的真实数据与调用。",
  "The explanation abstained. Inspect the rejected evidence before drawing a conclusion.": "解释已弃权。请先检查被拒绝的证据，再得出结论。",
  "The explanation abstained. Rejected claims are retained below for inspection; they are not supporting evidence. The explanation verdict and the original research tier are separate recorded fields.": "解释已弃权。被拒绝声明仍保留供检查，但不是支持证据。解释结论与原始研究立场是不同的记录字段。",
