  "The x axis is mean score percentile; the y axis is the share of names that beat the benchmark. The dashed horizontal line marks 50%. Each bucket combines settled outcomes from every asset pool. This is not a probability calibration.": "横轴是平均分数百分位，纵轴是跑赢基准的标的比例。水平虚线表示50%。每个区间合并全部资产池的已结算结果。这不是概率校准。",
  "These are the conditions recorded by the source. They are not a complete assessment of suitability or investment risk. {value1}": "这些条件来自来源记录，不构成完整的适当性或投资风险评估。{value1}",
  "These are the original recorded claims and checks. A verified claim is not a guarantee of future returns. Rejected claims remain visible and must not be treated as supporting evidence.": "以下是原始记录的声明与检查。“已验证”不保证未来收益。被拒绝声明保持可见，但不得视为支持证据。",
  "These journeys open existing validated data. No conversational Agent endpoint is connected here; selecting a journey does not generate a new model answer or recompute a ranking.": "这些路径打开已验证的数据记录。此处未连接对话式Agent接口；选择路径不会生成新模型回答或重算排名。",
